penai'\n\nTests (tests/):\n- 49 tests, 0 failures\n- Covers: step progression, final step, invalid transitions,\n  entity persistence, FAQ interruption, session isolation, cleanup\""},"tool_use_id":"toolu_011g5TQo7KSprG7eSXLBDVPc"}

