ouches it\nwarning: in the working copy of 'README.md', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it\nwarning: in the working copy of 'app/services/llm_service.py', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it\nwarning: in the working copy of 'app/services/rulebased.py', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it\n[main 08c2105a] Add navigation rules for status/refusal/TU-download; update docs\n 4 files changed, 419 insertions(+), 81 deletions(-)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Kyca8gtRvpoimVhd2xWbXQ","duration_ms":311}

2026-05-12T07:57:05.033Z {"session_id":"9fbbc20f-0fdc-4c8b-aa85-9b48cf5d424e","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\yasmi\\.claude\\projects\\e--workstuff-platform-ai-assistant\\9fbbc20f-0fdc-4c8b-aa85-9b48cf5d424e.jsonl","cwd":"E:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"Stop","stop_hook_active":false,"last_assistant_message":"Done. Here's what changed and why.\n\n---\n\n## What was done and why\n\n### Why `app/flows/` was NOT modified\n\n`linear.py` is a state machine — `next_state()` and `build_query()` only. Navigation strings there would mix content into routing, making both harder to test and maintain. The step-5 behavior already lives in `llm_service.py`'s `step_control_block`, which is the correct owner of step-specific instructions.\n\n### Where things actually landed\n\n**`rulebased.py`** — new `NAVIGATION_RULES` dict (answers without any LLM call):\n\n```\n\"статус заявки\"          → Личный кабинет → Услуги → вкладка Обращения\n\"мотивированный отказ\"   → same path + найти строку → Скачать / Просмотр\n\"скачать технические условия\" → same path + Скачать / Просмотр when Выполнено\n+ 10 Kazakh trigger phrases\n```\n\n**`llm_service.py`** — two changes:\n1. `<navigation_facts>` block added to both static prompts (RU + KZ) — used by the LLM when navigation comes up mid-conversation\n2. Step-5 note now appends: *\"После отправки статус и готовые ТУ появятся в Личный кабинет → Услуги → вкладка Обращения\"*\n\n**`CLAUDE.md`** — fully rewritten to reflect the current architecture, including a *\"Adding new navigation rules\"* section so future additions go to the right layer.\n\n**`README.md`** — written from scratch with quick start, API reference, navigation rules table, and project structure."}

