2026-05-12T08:50:44.188Z {"session_id":"312b487d-4e39-42c1-9f7b-e79ad731811e","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\yasmi\\.claude\\projects\\e--workstuff-platform-ai-assistant\\312b487d-4e39-42c1-9f7b-e79ad731811e.jsonl","cwd":"e:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","hook_event_name":"UserPromptSubmit","prompt":"Analyze CLAUDE.md before making changes.\nThere is mistake in conversation between me and AI assistent, he cant find answer but literally this answer can be in books:\nINFO:     127.0.0.1:59986 - \"GET /api/v1/documents HTTP/1.1\" 200 OK\nDEBUG — LightRAG query: step=None, intent=None, entity=None, lang=kz, q_len=55\nINFO:     127.0.0.1:49899 - \"GET /api/v1/documents HTTP/1.1\" 200 OK\nINFO:  == LLM cache == saving: hybrid:keywords:8cc34f6936cd3fda40ba6f62c00f744d\nINFO: Query nodes: жылжымайтын мүлік, профиль (top_k:7, cosine:0.2)\nINFO: Local query: 7 entites, 3 relations\nINFO: Query edges: Adding new real estate to profile (top_k:7, cosine:0.2)\nINFO: Global query: 11 entites, 7 relations\nINFO: Raw search results: 18 entities, 10 relations, 0 vector chunks\nINFO: After truncation: 18 entities, 10 relations\nINFO: Selecting 19 from 19 entity-related chunks by vector similarity\nINFO: Find no additional relations-related chunks from 10 relations\nINFO: Round-robin merged chunks: 19 -> 19 (deduplicated 0)\nWARNING: Rerank is enabled but no rerank model is configured. Please set up a rerank model or set enable_rerank=False in query parameters.\nINFO: Final context: 18 entities, 10 relations, 19 chunks\nINFO: Final chunks S+F/O: E2/1 E4/2 E4/3 E4/4 E2/5 E2/6 E3/7 E2/8 E2/9 E1/10 E2/11 E2/12 E1/13 E3/14 E2/15 E3/16 E1/17 E6/18 E1/19\nDEBUG — LightRAG context_len=39175, preview=\nKnowledge Graph Data (Entity):\n\n```json\n{\"entity\": \"ЛК Потребителя\", \"type\": \"location\", \"description\": \"The personal account page of the consumer.\"}\n{\"entity\": \"Добавить\", \"type\": \"method\", \"description\": \"Button to initiate the addition of a new real estate object.\"}\n{\"entity\": \"Статус\", \"type\": \nINFO:     127.0.0.1:62100 - \"POST /api/v1/chat HTTP/1.1\" 200 OK"}

