2026-05-14T13:17:54.048Z {"session_id":"7439697e-8f68-4e46-bc41-ecc4eba22aa6","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\yasmi\\.claude\\projects\\e--workstuff-platform-ai-assistant\\7439697e-8f68-4e46-bc41-ecc4eba22aa6.jsonl","cwd":"E:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"Stop","stop_hook_active":false,"last_assistant_message":"57/57. Summary of what changed and why:\n\n**`situation_pattern` + 3 downstream regexes** — Added `Шаг\\s+\\d+` to four places in `split_by_situations`:\n- The `re.split()` pattern (splits the doc on \"Шаг N\" headers)\n- The inner `re.match()` check (decides whether a part is a chunk header — without this, \"Шаг N\" parts would have been silently skipped even if split correctly)\n- The deduplication `norm_key` regex (normalizes \"Шаг 1: ...\" → \"Шаг 1\" as the dedup key)\n\n**`_extract_situation_number`** — \"Шаг N\" check inserted between the Ситуация/Жағдай check and the `\\d+.\\d+` check, so step numbers from step-by-step documents are correctly extracted.\n\n**`_slug_intent` new mappings** — Three logical groups:\n- \"расчет нагрузки\", \"эскизный\", \"строительно-монтажн\" → `\"tu_application\"` (these are stages of the same electrical-connection process, not separate services; tagging them as `\"tu_application\"` means RAG retrieval in the TU flow will find them)\n- \"договор бытов\" / \"договор небытов\" → `\"supply_contract\"` (distinct service: the actual supply agreement signed after TU approval)\n- \"пломб\" → `\"meter_sealing\"` (distinct service: meter installation/removal)\n\nThe two new slugs (`supply_contract`, `meter_sealing`) don't exist in `_FLOWS` yet, so they fall back to `FAQFlow` in the chat router — which is correct since no multi-step flow is defined for them. Their chunks will still be retrievable via semantic search with proper intent metadata in the KG."}

2026-05-14T14:28:51.140Z {"session_id":"7439697e-8f68-4e46-bc41-ecc4eba22aa6","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\yasmi\\.claude\\projects\\e--workstuff-platform-ai-assistant\\7439697e-8f68-4e46-bc41-ecc4eba22aa6.jsonl","cwd":"e:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","hook_event_name":"UserPromptSubmit","prompt":"IMPORTANT:\n- Do NOT blindly follow my implementation suggestions.\n- First identify architectural problems, hidden bugs, regressions, duplicated logic, and better alternatives.\n- If my proposed solution is suboptimal, explain why and implement a safer/better approach.\n- Preserve backward compatibility whenever possible.\n- Avoid overengineering.\n- Keep changes modular and maintainable.\n- After implementation, RUN TESTS and fix regressions until everything passes.\n\nСделай 2 изменения в моём проекте:\n\nФАЙЛ 1: app/services/lightrag_service.py\n\nВ функцию search_docs() добавь ПЕРЕД строкой `log_rag_search(...)` эту функцию фильтрации:\n\n```python\ndef _filter_context_by_intent(context: str, intent: str | None) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Remove chunks from unrelated services to avoid mixed templates.\"\"\"\n    if not intent or not context:\n        return context\n    \n    # Intent-specific keywords to identify relevant chunks\n    intent_keywords = {\n        \"tu_application\": [\n            \"заявление на технические условия\",\n            \"технические условия\",\n            \"техусловия\",\n            \"шаг 1\", \"шаг 2\", \"шаг 3\", \"шаг 4\", \"шаг 5\",\n            \"фио\", \"иин\", \"бин\", \"физическое лицо\", \"юридическое лицо\",\n        ],\n        \"real_estate\": [\n            \"объект недвижимости\",\n            \"кадастровый номер\",\n            \"адресный регистр\",\n            \"добавление объекта\",\n            \"через кадастр\",\n        ],\n    }\n    \n    keywords = intent_keywords.get(intent, [])\n    if not keywords:\n        return context\n    \n    # Split by double newline (LightRAG standard chunk separator)\n    chunks = context.split(\"\\n\\n\")\n    relevant_chunks = []\n    \n    for chunk in chunks:\n        chunk_lower = chunk.lower()\n        # Keep chunk if it contains intent keywords or has [INTENT: ...] tag\n        if any(kw in chunk_lower for kw in keywords) or f\"[INTENT: {intent}]\" in chunk:\n            relevant_chunks.append(chunk)\n    \n    # If filtering removed everything, return original (better mixed than empty)\n    if not relevant_chunks:\n        return context\n    \n    return \"\\n\\n\".join(relevant_chunks)\n```\n\nПосле этой функции, замени строку:\n\n```python\nlog_rag_search(query, intent or \"none\", language or \"auto\", len(context.split(\"\\n\")))\n```\n\nНа:\n\n```python\n# Filter context by intent to avoid mixing templates from different services\nif intent:\n    context = _filter_context_by_intent(context, intent)\n\nlog_rag_search(query, intent or \"none\", language or \"auto\", len(context.split(\"\\n\")))\n```\n\nФАЙЛ 2: app/services/lightrag_service.py\n\nВ функции search_docs() найди строку:\n\n```python\nresult = await rag.aquery(\n    enriched_query,\n    param=QueryParam(\n        mode=\"hybrid\",\n        only_need_context=True,\n        top_k=top_k,\n    ),\n)\n```\n\nЗамени top_k на условный:\n\n```python\n# Reduce top_k for intent-specific searches to avoid cross-service contamination\neffective_top_k = 3 if intent else top_k\n\nresult = await rag.aquery(\n    enriched_query,\n    param=QueryParam(\n        mode=\"hybrid\",\n        only_need_context=True,\n        top_k=effective_top_k,\n    ),\n)\n```\n\nТАКЖЕ опционально - если нужна логирование:\nДобавь в конце функции search_docs() перед return:\n\n```python\nif intent and len(context) < 100:\n    print(f\"⚠️  LightRAG returned very little context for intent={intent}. Consider lowering filter strictness.\")\n```"}

2026-05-14T14:29:22.134Z {"session_id":"7439697e-8f68-4e46-bc41-ecc4eba22aa6","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\yasmi\\.claude\\projects\\e--workstuff-platform-ai-assistant\\7439697e-8f68-4e46-bc41-ecc4eba22aa6.jsonl","cwd":"e:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"e:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant\\app\\services\\lightrag_service.py"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_018xzQzStpWV4kkJSJXYX5zP"}

2026-05-14T14:29:22.582Z {"session_id":"7439697e-8f68-4e46-bc41-ecc4eba22aa6","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\yasmi\\.claude\\projects\\e--workstuff-platform-ai-assistant\\7439697e-8f68-4e46-bc41-ecc4eba22aa6.jsonl","cwd":"e:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"e:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant\\app\\services\\lightrag_service.py"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"e:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant\\app\\services\\lightrag_service.py","content":"import os\nimport numpy as np\nfrom openai import AsyncOpenAI\nfrom lightrag import LightRAG, QueryParam\nfrom lightrag.utils import EmbeddingFunc\nfrom app.utils.logger import log_rag_search, log_qdrant_error\n\n# Separate clients with different timeouts\n_oai_embeddings = AsyncOpenAI(api_key=os.environ.get(\"OPENAI_API_KEY\", \"\"), timeout=300.0)\n_oai_llm = AsyncOpenAI(api_key=os.environ.get(\"OPENAI_API_KEY\", \"\"), timeout=600.0)\n\n\nasync def gpt41_nano_complete(\n    prompt: str,\n    system_prompt: str | None = None,\n    history_messages: list[dict] = [],\n    **kwargs,\n) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Custom LLM function for gpt-4.1-nano via OpenAI SDK.\"\"\"\n    messages = []\n    if system_prompt:\n        messages.append({\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": system_prompt})\n    messages.extend(history_messages)\n    messages.append({\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": prompt})\n\n    try:\n        response = await _oai_llm.chat.completions.create(\n            model=\"gpt-4.1-nano\",\n            messages=messages,\n            temperature=kwargs.get(\"temperature\", 0.0),\n            max_tokens=kwargs.get(\"max_tokens\", 2000),\n        )\n        return response.choices[0].message.content\n    except Exception as e:\n        log_qdrant_error(f\"gpt41_nano_complete failed: {str(e)}\")\n        raise\n\n\nasync def openai_embed(texts: list[str]) -> np.ndarray:\n    \"\"\"Embedding function using OpenAI text-embedding-3-small.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        response = await _oai_embeddings.embeddings.create(\n            model=\"text-embedding-3-small\",\n            input=texts,\n            encoding_format=\"float\",\n        )\n        return np.array([item.embedding for item in response.data])\n    except Exception as e:\n        log_qdrant_error(f\"openai_embed failed: {str(e)}\")\n        raise\n\n\n# Initialize LightRAG with GPT-4.1-nano and OpenAI embeddings\n# Timeouts are configured at the OpenAI client level (_oai_embeddings, _oai_llm)\nrag = LightRAG(\n    working_dir=\"./data/lightrag\",\n    llm_model_func=gpt41_nano_complete,\n    embedding_func=EmbeddingFunc(\n        embedding_dim=1536,\n        max_token_size=8192,\n        func=openai_embed,\n    ),\n    chunk_token_size=1200,\n    chunk_overlap_token_size=100,\n    rerank_model_func=None,\n)\n\n\nasync def initialize():\n    \"\"\"Initialize LightRAG storage. Must be called in FastAPI lifespan.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        await rag.initialize_storages()\n        print(\"✅ LightRAG initialized\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"❌ LightRAG initialization failed: {str(e)}\")\n        raise\n\n\nasync def search_docs(\n    query: str,\n    top_k: int = 7,\n    intent: str = None,\n    entity: str = None,\n    page: str = None,\n    language: str = None,\n    current_step: int = None,\n) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Search the knowledge graph for context.\n\n    Args:\n        query: User question\n        top_k: Number of nodes to retrieve (passed to QueryParam)\n        intent: \"tu_application\" or \"real_estate\" (prepended to query)\n        entity: \"физическое лицо\" or \"юридическое лицо\" (prepended to query)\n        page: Page context (not directly used, kept for API compatibility)\n        language: \"ru\" or \"kz\" (kept for future language-specific filtering)\n        current_step: Current step number for multi-step processes (prepended to query)\n\n    Returns:\n        Formatted context string for the LLM\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        # Prepend step, intent, and entity to query for graph extraction\n        enriched_query = query\n        if current_step is not None:\n            enriched_query = f\"[Шаг {current_step}] {enriched_query}\"\n        if intent:\n            enriched_query = f\"[{intent}] {enriched_query}\"\n        if entity:\n            enriched_query = f\"[{entity}] {enriched_query}\"\n            # Append entity-specific terms to help LightRAG disambiguate\n            # ФЛ vs ЮЛ chunks when both exist for the same step.\n            if \"юридическое\" in entity:\n                enriched_query += \" БИН организация руководитель\"\n            elif \"физическое\" in entity:\n                enriched_query += \" ФИО ИИН\"\n\n        print(f\"DEBUG — LightRAG query: step={current_step}, intent={intent}, entity={entity}, lang={language}, q_len={len(query)}\")\n\n        # Query knowledge graph with only_need_context=True\n        # This returns raw context without LLM generation\n        result = await rag.aquery(\n            enriched_query,\n            param=QueryParam(\n                mode=\"hybrid\",\n                only_need_context=True,\n                top_k=top_k,\n            ),\n        )\n\n        # LightRAG returns a string with context\n        context = result if isinstance(result, str) else str(result)\n\n        log_rag_search(query, intent or \"none\", language or \"auto\", len(context.split(\"\\n\")))\n\n        print(f\"DEBUG — LightRAG context_len={len(context)}, preview={context[:300] if context else 'EMPTY'}\")\n\n        return context if context else \"\"\n\n    except Exception as e:\n        log_qdrant_error(f\"LightRAG search failed: {type(e).__name__}: {str(e)}\")\n        print(f\"❌ LightRAG search failed: {type(e).__name__}: {str(e)}\")\n        return \"\"\n\n\nasync def insert_text(text: str, metadata: str = \"\"):\n    \"\"\"\n    Insert text into the knowledge graph.\n\n    Args:\n        text: Document text to insert\n        metadata: Optional metadata string (e.g., \"[INTENT: tu_application] [LANGUAGE: ru]\")\n    \"\"\"\n    if not text or not text.strip():\n        print(f\"⚠️  Skipping empty text insert\")\n        return\n\n    insert_text_content = text\n    if metadata:\n        insert_text_content = f\"{metadata}\\n\\n{text}\"\n\n    try:\n        await rag.ainsert(insert_text_content)\n        print(f\"✅ Inserted text ({len(text)} chars) into knowledge graph\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"❌ LightRAG insert failed: {str(e)}\")\n        raise\n","numLines":169,"startLine":1,"totalLines":169}},"tool_use_id":"toolu_018xzQzStpWV4kkJSJXYX5zP","duration_ms":2}

2026-05-14T14:30:17.770Z {"session_id":"7439697e-8f68-4e46-bc41-ecc4eba22aa6","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\yasmi\\.claude\\projects\\e--workstuff-platform-ai-assistant\\7439697e-8f68-4e46-bc41-ecc4eba22aa6.jsonl","cwd":"e:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"e:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant\\app\\services\\lightrag_service.py","old_string":"async def initialize():","new_string":"# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Context post-filtering\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n# Keywords that identify chunks as belonging to a specific service intent.\n# Both RU and KZ forms are included because the KG stores bilingual content.\n_INTENT_FILTER_KEYWORDS: dict[str, list[str]] = {\n    \"tu_application\": [\n        # Russian\n        \"технические условия\", \"техусловия\", \"заявление на технические\",\n        \"шаг 1\", \"шаг 2\", \"шаг 3\", \"шаг 4\", \"шаг 5\",\n        \"фио\", \"иин\", \"бин\", \"физическое лицо\", \"юридическое лицо\",\n        \"электроснабжение\", \"электрических сетей\",\n        # Kazakh\n        \"техникалық шарттар\", \"жеке тұлға\", \"заңды тұлға\",\n        \"1-қадам\", \"2-қадам\", \"3-қадам\", \"4-қадам\", \"5-қадам\",\n        \"электрмен жабдықтау\",\n    ],\n    \"real_estate\": [\n        # Russian\n        \"объект недвижимости\", \"кадастровый номер\",\n        \"адресный регистр\", \"добавление объекта\", \"через кадастр\",\n        # Kazakh\n        \"жылжымайтын мүлік\", \"кадастрлық нөмір\",\n        \"адрестік регистр\", \"объект қосу\",\n    ],\n}\n\n\ndef _filter_context_by_intent(context: str, intent: str | None) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Remove chunks from unrelated services to avoid mixed templates.\n\n    Splits the LightRAG context on double-newline paragraph breaks and keeps\n    only chunks that contain intent-specific keywords or the [INTENT:] tag.\n    Falls back to the full context if filtering removes everything.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not intent or not context:\n        return context\n    keywords = _INTENT_FILTER_KEYWORDS.get(intent, [])\n    if not keywords:\n        return context\n\n    chunks = context.split(\"\\n\\n\")\n    relevant = [\n        chunk for chunk in chunks\n        if any(kw in chunk.lower() for kw in keywords)\n        or f\"[INTENT: {intent}]\" in chunk\n    ]\n    # If filtering removed everything, return original — mixed is better than empty\n    return \"\\n\\n\".join(relevant) if relevant else context\n\n\nasync def initialize():","replace_all":false},"tool_use_id":"toolu_019DieDDJoFjmYQv53rn4tWA"}

